From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 13:24:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] win32u: Let an installed free math font stand in for Cambria
 Math.

Word lays out equations only with a font that has a MATH table, and its
default for them is Cambria Math, which Windows always has and Wine
neither has nor ships.  Asked for it, GDI gave Liberation Sans, and
every equation came out empty: on screen, in the saved document's
pages and in PDF exports.  Setting the document's math font to a free
one with a MATH table brought the equations back.

When no font of that name is installed, the first of the free math
fonts that is now takes its name, as a replacement in the registry
would give it, and one given in the registry still comes first.  Those
with TrueType outlines are tried first: Word draws the glyphs of a
font it cannot embed as images, and those of the CFF math fonts come
out wrong under Wine.  With DejaVu Math TeX Gyre standing in, Word's
equations, left in Cambria Math, are drawn and exported as with it
chosen by hand; gdi32's font test fails the same with the
replacements as without.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
(cherry picked from commit a84f7a522b81547a4219b3886c7a8ebe8b056d89)

diff --git a/dlls/win32u/font.c b/dlls/win32u/font.c
index 5bb62164c47..3aea7dd95f0 100644
--- a/dlls/win32u/font.c
+++ b/dlls/win32u/font.c
@@ -994,6 +994,29 @@ static void load_gdi_font_replacements(void)
     NtClose( hkey );
 }
 
+/* Windows always has Cambria Math, and Office lays out its equations only with a font that has a MATH table: with the
+ * font a font without one takes its place and every equation comes out empty.  When it is missing, the first free math
+ * font installed takes its name, those with TrueType outlines first.  A replacement in the registry comes first. */
+static void load_default_font_replacements(void)
+{
+    static const char math_fonts[] =
+        "DejaVu Math TeX Gyre\0STIX Two Math\0Latin Modern Math\0TeX Gyre Termes Math\0TeX Gyre Pagella Math\0"
+        "TeX Gyre Bonum Math\0TeX Gyre Schola Math\0TeX Gyre DejaVu Math\0Libertinus Math\0XITS Math\0"
+        "Asana Math\0Fira Math\0";
+    WCHAR name[LF_FACESIZE], replace[LF_FACESIZE];
+    const char *font;
+
+    if (getenv( "CX_TURN_OFF_FONT_REPLACEMENTS" )) return;
+
+    asciiz_to_unicode( name, "Cambria Math" );
+    if (find_family_from_any_name( name )) return;
+    for (font = math_fonts; *font; font += strlen( font ) + 1)
+    {
+        asciiz_to_unicode( replace, font );
+        if (add_family_replacement( name, replace )) break;
+    }
+}
+
 static void dump_gdi_font_list(void)
 {
     struct gdi_font_family *family;
@@ -6924,6 +6947,7 @@ UINT font_init(void)
     reorder_font_list();
     load_gdi_font_subst();
     load_gdi_font_replacements();
+    load_default_font_replacements();
     load_system_links();
     dump_gdi_font_list();
     dump_gdi_font_subst();
